# Exclude installed/build artifacts (rebuilt inside the image), not source.
# NOTE: workspace package manifests (incl. apps/mobile) MUST remain so that
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` can resolve the full workspace graph.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.expo
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
